        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Liquid crystals have the following general properties."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "They have a parallel, ordered arrangement.",
              "Their molecules are elongated, rod-like and linear.",
              "They flow like liquids.",
              "They show viscosity like liquids.",
              "They show optical properties like crystals.",
              "They are somewhat rigid.",
              "They are always anisotropic."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "Liquid crystals compared with the two states",
