          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Name the properties in which liquid crystals resemble solids, and those in which they resemble liquids.",
            "explanation": "Like solids they have an ordered parallel arrangement, crystal-like optical properties, some rigidity and anisotropy. Like liquids they flow and show viscosity."
